{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Poisson rouge","Atteint d'une maladie neurodégénérative, Guillaume va terminer de perdre la mémoire en centre spécialisé. Dans l'espoir de lui laisser un souvenir heureux, ses potes d'enfance lui organisent un dernier weekend festif, sous le signe du bon vin. Mais si Guillaume peut passer trois fois la même commande au bar, certaines blessures de son passé sont toujours ouvertes. Accompagné de ses amis, il décide de se lancer dans un road trip qui lui permettra peut-être de régler ses problèmes avant qu'il ne les oublie...",[4,5],"fatherhood","grandmotherhood",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":34,"media":37,"synopsis":40,"production":41,"characters":44,"roles":45,"awards":70,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_170","fr2023-170-poisson-rouge",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-09-27",2023,"Fiction film",[18,26,30],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Hugo Bachelet","hugo-bachelet",1984,0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":29},"Clément Vallos","clement-vallos",[],{"id":31,"slug":32,"name":31,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":33},"Matthieu Yakovleff","matthieu-yakovleff",[],[35,36],"Comedy","Road Movie",{"posterUrl":38,"trailerUrl":39},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/212/7/264148/format_page/poisson-rouge.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ie6i4YEaQ8Y",{"native":2,"english":11},[42],{"country":24,"share":43},"Majority coproducer",[],[46,54,58,64,67],{"person":47,"role":53},{"id":48,"slug":49,"name":48,"birthYear":50,"deathYear":22,"gender":51,"nationality":24,"awards":52},"Claudette Walker","claudette-walker",1940,"Female identifying",[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":55,"role":57},{"id"